   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Types of warehouses"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Private warehouses are owned by manufacturers or traders for their own goods. Public warehouses are licensed by the government and rent space to anyone. Bonded warehouses store imported goods until customs duty is paid. Government warehouses are run by bodies such as the Central Warehousing Corporation, and cooperative warehouses are owned by cooperative societies."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Private"
    },
    {
     "en": "Public"
    },
    {
     "en": "Bonded"
    },
    {
     "en": "Government (e.g. CWC)"
    },
    {
     "en": "Cooperative"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Private warehouses are owned by manufacturers or traders for their own goods. Public warehouses are licensed by the government and rent space to anyone. Bonded warehouses store imported goods until customs duty is paid. Government warehouses are run by bodies such as the Central Warehousing Corporation, and cooperative warehouses are owned by cooperative societies.",
    "kn": "ಖಾಸಗಿ, ಸಾರ್ವಜನಿಕ, ಬಂಧಿತ, ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ ಮತ್ತು ಸಹಕಾರಿ ಉಗ್ರಾಣಗಳು ಇವೆ. ಬಂಧಿತ ಉಗ್ರಾಣಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಸುಂಕ ಪಾವತಿಸುವವರೆಗೆ ಆಮದು ಸರಕನ್ನು ಇಡಲಾಗುತ್ತದೆ."
   }
  },
